{"version":1,"key":"article:9","content":{"id":9,"title":"方程与框图的转换","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e619242f-19e0-411d-9477-6b0c26e9f79e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在信号与系统中我们很容易碰到这种题目，给出框图，列出微分(差分方程)或者给出方程，画出框图，有进一步的还要求列出状态方程。这个问题一开始刚接触时确实令我听挺烦恼的，因为一开始没有抓住诀窍，后来想通了，便觉得十分的简单，现在这里记录一二，以便以后用起时方便查询。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"5208637f-f172-4ec5-a8fc-27359ea113a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"原理概述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"c5bffb6c-8d75-4574-8fcc-bcbfd11a62de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先我们要明白下面这么一个事实，若(以连续时间系统为例，离散同理)"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"ac5f415d-91c2-4825-adec-1609fcdc6bc0","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"x(t) \\rightarrow y(t) \\Rightarrow x^{'}(t) \\rightarrow y^{'}(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d4e03b95-51ce-4d19-85a7-680159d0b333","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以及若"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"660d6f5e-8fc3-417b-8856-691b21a78828","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nx_1(t) &\\rightarrow y_1(t) \\\\\nx_2(t) &\\rightarrow y_2(t)\n\\end{aligned}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"de15bff5-bd61-4974-801a-7f2fc180dfb5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"则"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"cdc87ca9-b52f-4e02-87fb-6fecdb00b833","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"x_1(t) + x_2(t) \\rightarrow y_1(t) + y_2(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"310d3cb7-39c4-4183-a98d-1031682f1866","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在明白上面的事实的基础上，那么对于一般的微分方程(以二阶为例)"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"5248053f-73c2-4f21-bf96-9a7bcf0e631e","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"y^{''}(t) + a_1y^{'}(t) + a_0y(t) = b_2x^{''}(t) + b_1x^{'}(t) + b_0x(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d8d4a519-2540-484a-b9c3-d20da6f2e7f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的式子可以化为"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"84a959f6-af9b-418d-b420-016d1e618c3a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\lambda^{''}(t) + a_1\\lambda^{'}(t) + a_0\\lambda(t) = x(t) \\\\\ny(t) = b_2\\lambda^{''}(t) + b_1\\lambda^{'}(t) + b_0\\lambda(t)\n\\end{aligned}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d3d11ff1-3e15-4b25-9116-49cebdf02b72","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的式子很容易理解，由"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"5ab2a99f-dd35-4473-8271-56a86678fa0a","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\lambda^{''}(t) + a_1\\lambda^{'}(t) + a_0\\lambda(t) = x(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d4d57b44-c06e-4830-bee9-d580c3bc4369","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"知"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"4057640f-463b-4a58-bc44-e85b856b78cc","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"x(t) \\rightarrow \\lambda(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"008d9d9a-a575-49ef-8949-16741e5bfc92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"则根据上面的铺垫，得"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"358e70f2-ff6c-4aa2-a5b5-edb96a5b1ba4","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"b_2x^{''}(t) + b_1x^{'}(t) + b_0x(t) \\rightarrow b_2\\lambda^{''}(t) + b_1\\lambda^{'}(t) + b_0\\lambda(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"bd885324-bbfd-4f30-a80e-499453a8c504","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"f4d54be2-f7f1-4cfd-a1c5-2a8e5f6fe6c7","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"y(t) = b_2\\lambda^{''}(t) + b_1\\lambda^{'}(t) + b_0\\lambda(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e62abcdb-2f48-418c-a75b-e014032dd1bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"至此原理已经讲完，下面讲如何根据上面两个式子得到框图。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"3a83da46-8e88-40ec-be51-084114f20f9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"得到框图"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"37edb2c8-0fa3-44cc-8e10-45214a30dfc5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先明确一点，我们在实际中用的都是积分器，为什么不用微分器，因为微分器会把噪声放大。因为这是一个二阶方程，所以需要两个积分器，如下"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_db24f522-7714-4159-8a4a-c79d1729ef88.webp","uuid":"176ca652-2bd0-49d5-aa72-0dfec4e4a667","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_db24f522-7714-4159-8a4a-c79d1729ef88.webp","width":463.3333149221216,"collabId":"ff575271-c372-45c5-b0b7-35034141e96d","naturalWidth":1112,"naturalHeight":242,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"81b3193c-93ef-471d-bac7-3bd12257411b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据第一个方程"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"06550405-70f7-49d8-a802-7c56dde57b71","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"\\lambda^{''}(t) + a_1\\lambda^{'}(t) + a_0\\lambda(t) = x(t) \\Rightarrow \\lambda^{''}(t) = -a_1\\lambda^{'}(t) - a_0\\lambda(t) + x(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"cb464065-a5e7-43c3-a75c-433f449b86a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"很容易得到这么一个框图"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0bf17e64-6c4f-41be-9fdb-840a8f114335.webp","uuid":"97fdd54f-6fe1-4f31-b72b-eb42a40c2111","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0bf17e64-6c4f-41be-9fdb-840a8f114335.webp","width":571.6666439506752,"collabId":"2be114f9-6aeb-4ed2-a81a-fceca86401f1","naturalWidth":1372,"naturalHeight":438,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"99ccbeaf-d477-4ff0-ad78-360104dc6753","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"d27be19d-53da-46fe-9fcb-7f66fba9b694","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"y(t) = b_2\\lambda^{''}(t) + b_1\\lambda^{'}(t) + b_0\\lambda(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"8fecfb8c-ef8a-4b01-8a92-549939c6cbec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以得到"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2bd6090d-d331-4412-b727-a02971fad825.webp","uuid":"53245f0d-8a33-44db-9768-4906760bc47c","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2bd6090d-d331-4412-b727-a02971fad825.webp","width":720,"collabId":"ddedfebe-939f-4d05-bf21-ffe7a85d8095","naturalWidth":1782,"naturalHeight":580,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"collabId":"e3422b28-f89a-4c40-be88-95e3b13ce55c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"总结"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"17677504-d083-4041-abf2-bcc8644f0917","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以综上，方程"}]},{"type":"block-math","collabId":"f5f6aece-64ed-43cd-9f79-d6205451ff45","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"tex":"y^{''}(t) + a_1y^{'}(t) + a_0y(t) = b_2x^{''}(t) + b_1x^{'}(t) + b_0x(t)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6d04a307-9b8b-4e44-aafa-2065c2beb980","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对应的框图为"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bedb672e-06c4-48b2-93d2-3059d4fc1ba8.webp","uuid":"9a26e749-7b7e-4379-b722-e9abf33061db","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bedb672e-06c4-48b2-93d2-3059d4fc1ba8.webp","width":720,"collabId":"27b83fbf-b3c6-43ce-b335-ee32343adab4","naturalWidth":1782,"naturalHeight":580,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}],"tags":["数字信号处理","Z变换","差分方程","方框图"],"bannerBg":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2023/raw/master/wallhaven-o37o8l_f8704f80-fa26-4679-8b91-0eecce909c3a.jpg","createTime":1571040840000,"updateTime":1791979710235},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1791979710235}}